:: Meal False Sympathie [activity meal] {"position":"1725,2100"}
/*
{
        id: "false_sympathie",
        passage: "Meal False Sympathie",
        isActive: false,
        mealType: ["dinner"],
        isImportant: true,
        dayType: ["weekday", "weekend"],
        cooldown: 0,
        once: true,
        lastSeen: -1,
        present: ["mom", "sister"],
        requirements: [
        ],
        set: [
            () => setup.getMealById("false_sympathie").isActive = false,
        ]
}
   Activated by: "False Sympathy" (mom_falseSympathy). She was fired over the files I deleted,
   and said yes to working for me. The first family dinner since.
*/
It's takeout tonight. Nobody had the energy to cook, and nobody said so out loud. The cartons are lined up in the middle of the table and $mom.callName has put them on real plates anyway, because some rules survive even getting fired.

/* IMAGE: images/meals/important/false_sympathie.jpg | Chinese takeout cartons on the kitchen table, served onto real plates. Mom tired but composed. Sister leaning forward, elbows on the table, curious. */

$sister.callName waits until everyone has food before she brings it up.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $sister, text: "So, are we going to talk about it, or are we pretending you're on vacation?" },
{ who: $mom, text: "$sister.callName..." },
{ who: $sister, text: "I'm not trying to be mean. I'd just like to know whether I should be panicking, because I have a midterm on Thursday and there's only so much panic I can fit into one week." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Nobody needs to panic, sweetheart, I already have a new job." },
{ who: $sister, text: "Already? Where?" },
{ text: "$mom.callName looks at me. It's a strange look, half embarrassed and half proud, the look of a woman about to admit that her new boss still leaves his socks in the hallway." },
{ who: $mom, text: "With your $sister.playerRelation, at his company." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

There's a long pause. $sister.callName puts her chopsticks down.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $sister, text: "Hold on. So he's your boss now? Our little $sister.callPlayerShort, who still can't find the laundry basket, signs your paychecks?" },
{ who: $player, text: "Technically, yes. I'm going to be a very fair boss, though. Firm, but fair." },
{ who: $sister, text: "$mom.callName, if he ever writes you up, I want to be in the room." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Nobody is writing anybody up, you two." },
{ who: $sister, text: "This is honestly the best thing that's happened in this house all year." },
{ text: "And then $mom.callName laughs. It's small and surprised and a little wet around the edges, but it's the first real laugh I've heard from her in weeks, and $sister.callName looks so relieved that she reaches over and steals an egg roll off my plate to celebrate." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

Later, while $sister.callName loads the dishwasher badly and $mom.callName pretends not to watch, she sits back down next to me with a cup of tea.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "I still don't understand it, you know, those files. I had a backup of that forecast, I'm sure I did, and the client folder... I'm so careful with that folder, honey, I color-code it." },
{ who: $player, text: "Maybe the laptop glitched. Those old work machines are garbage." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Maybe. I just keep going over it in my head." },
{ who: $player, text: "Then maybe stop going over it? It's done, and you're out of there, which honestly is the best part of all this." },
{ who: $mom, text: "You're right. You're right, sweetie, it's a new start, and I'm going to treat it like one." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

She pats my hand and goes to rescue the dishwasher. I stay where I am a little longer. Her laptop is still sitting on the side table in the living room where she dropped it the other night, and I should get rid of the deleted-items folder before she thinks of looking at it again.

<<UpdateStat "+" "MomRelation" 3>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 1>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "Corruption" 1>>
